        "description": "Exhausted or Nauseous is a tiny social status app for when words are too much.\n\nTap Exhausted or Nauseous to let your friends know how you’re doing. Add friends, see their vibe, and get a ping when they check in.\n\n• One-tap status for friends\n• Simple profiles with optional photo\n• Friend requests and search\n• Push notifications when friends update\n\nSign in with your phone number. No endless feed — just the signal.",
